# Looking-for-group and trade lines built from parts (the month simulation, 2026-10-26: 130 lfg lines met about 830 lfg
# lines a month). Real lfg spam was formulaic, so these vary the formula: order, what is wanted, how long, a sign-off.
# "[a|b]" parts are expanded by build_corpus.py. New writing.

# ---- lfg_self ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
@kind lfg
@topic lfg_self
@who *
@needs solo
@invites lfg
[lfg|lf grp|lf group] {level} {class}[, | - ][any xp|anything really|xp group|dungeon or camp, dont mind][ pst| /tell me|]
{level} {class} [lfg|looking for group|lf grp][, ][can start now|ready to go|full pots|got time][ pst|]
{class} {level} [lfg|lf any group][, ][been solo too long|solo is slow|bored of soloing|need the xp]
[anyone need a|any group need a|group need a] {level} {class}[?|? pst|? happy to travel]
[lfg|lf grp] {level} {class}[, know my class|, been playing a while|, wont die on you][, pst|]
[lfg|lf group] {level} {class}[, couple hours|, an hour or so][ to play|]
{level} {class} [here|over here][, lfg|, looking][, any level close to mine|, any camp]
@who Socialite
[lfg|lf group] {level} {class}[, good company|, will chat|, no drama][ pst|]
@who Leveler
[lfg|lf grp] {level} {class}[, fast xp only|, want to push a level|, steady pulls preferred][ pst|]
@who Daredevil
[lfg|lf grp] {level} {class}[, oranges and reds welcome|, the harder the better|, lets pull big]
@who NoLifer
[lfg|lf grp] {level} {class}[, on for hours|, not logging anytime soon|, here for hours]
@who Crafter
{level} {class} [lfg|lf grp][, need coin for my craft|, taking a break from crafting][ pst|]
@who Explorer
[lfg|lf grp] {level} {class}[, somewhere i havent been|, show me a new camp|, anywhere new]
@who *
@needs solo,xp_high
{level} {class} [lfg|lf grp][, almost a ding|, close to a ding|, few bubbles to go][ pst|]
@needs solo,xp_low
{level} {class} [lfg|lf grp][, just dinged and want to keep going|, fresh level, need xp]

# ---- trade: buying and selling in general terms --------------------------------------------
@kind trade
@topic buying
@who *
@needs
[wtb|looking for|anyone got] [armor|a weapon|jewelry|a shield] for a {level} {class}[, pst|, paying fair|]
[wtb|need] [potions|power pots|health pots|dye][, anyone|, will pay|, pst]
[anyone sell|wtb] [a better cloak|a ring or two|some bracers|a decent belt] [for|around] level {level}[?|, pst]
@topic selling
@who Crafter
[making|finishing] [armor|weapons|tailored stuff] [for the guild|for my alt|for skill ups][, materials cost a fortune|]
[doing guild orders|crafting for the guild][, materials are killing me|, slow going|]
[crafter here|crafting tonight], [making|finishing] [armor|weapons|arrows|tailored gear] for [guildies|my guild|my alts]
@needs evening
[crafting all evening|at the forge tonight], [guild orders first|skill ups all night]
